### Candidate 15: forall[16,16] (tile_sizes [8,8]) + tile[4,8,16] + vectorize [4,8,16] *** BEST BEFORE UNROLLING ***
- Asymmetric inner tile: 4 M rows, 8 N cols
- Vectors: vector<4x8x16xf64>=512 elems ✓
- Result: 0.044 ms (134.5x speedup, 3.27x FASTER than PyTorch)

### Candidate 16: forall[16,16] + tile[8,8,8] + vectorize [8,8,8]
